0..71 Comment "// The laws of a category with families, refused until the rule reading"
72..148 Comment "// carries an index at a sort the laws rewrite (Huang and Angiuli, _Fat Cell"
149..210 Comment "// Structures and Generalized Algebraic Theories_, LICS 2026,"
211..255 Comment "// doi:10.4230/LIPIcs.LICS.2026.58, § 1.1)."
256..258 Comment "//"
259..336 Comment "// The category laws rewrite substitutions, a type moves along a substitution"
337..413 Comment "// and comprehension takes a type. So every sort of the CwF is flexible, and"
414..464 Comment "// the rule reading carries none of their indices."
465..467 Comment "//"
468..543 Comment "// Without the indices two laws part where the sorting joins them. A law on"
544..616 Comment "// terms relates two sides whose sorts agree only modulo a law on types."
617..619 Comment "//"
620..635 Comment "// - see: #5016"
